    {
      "source": "Doctors of Running",
      "priority": 3,
      "url": "https://www.doctorsofrunning.com/2025/07/nike-structure-26-review-2025.html",
      "type": "qualitative",
      "keyFindings": [
        "Cushioning: Full-length ReactX delivers a softer, well-cushioned ride with solid impact protection for easy and longer runs, but heel landings can feel clunky and the foam can feel dead after about 12-14 miles.",
        "Responsiveness: Energy return is moderate-to-low; it is smoother but less snappy than Structure 25, with limited bounce and weaker pace-up performance due to the heavier, less lively ride.",
        "Stability: Moderate stability is strongest in the heel and midfoot from the medial sidewall/post-like guidance, lateral heel sidewall, wide midfoot base, and moderately stiff heel counter; forefoot support is comparatively neutral.",
        "Durability: Durability is above average, with thick heel outsole rubber showing almost no wear after 30 miles; some forefoot outsole wear appears, but overall outsole and midsole longevity look strong."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "Road Trail Run",
      "priority": 4,
      "url": "https://www.roadtrailrun.com/2025/07/nike-structure-26-multi-tester-review.html",
      "type": "qualitative",
      "keyFindings": [
        "Cushioning: The full-length ReactX midsole (38 mm heel / 28 mm forefoot) is described as plush and soft, with smoother impact protection and a more uniform heel-to-forefoot feel after removing the forefoot Air Zoom unit.",
        "Responsiveness: ReactX gives a natural, moderate energy return, but testers characterize the ride as more recovery-pace friendly than truly bouncy or snappy.",
        "Stability: Stability comes from subtle guidance rather than rigid posting, driven by the internal midfoot fit band, high medial/lateral crash rails, secure heel hold, and reinforced forefoot structure for controlled lateral support.",
        "Durability: The review claims improved material longevity from ReactX and a better-executed upper, but it does not provide concrete outsole wear results from long-term testing."
      ]
    }
